CREDIT NOTICE

This application is an implementation of the tutorial "Dogs, JavaScript & An API - Fetch,
Promises & Async Await" by Brad Schiff (LearnWebCode),
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AVmGmLFcukM. The application concept and the fetch /
promise / async-await structure are his work, with full credit given.

The tutorial is published as an instructional video and does not carry its own license
file. The code in this repository was written by hand while following the tutorial and is
released under the MIT terms above.

Breed data and photographs are provided by the Dog CEO API (https://dog.ceo/dog-api/),
which is free to use.
